From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Joe Hershberger <joe.hershberger@ni.com>
Date: Mon, 10 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] u-boot: use GNU89 C and inline semantics

This legacy tree relies on GNU89 inline semantics and uses identifiers
such as bool that are keywords in C23. Select the GNU89 language mode for
the GCC 15 toolchain.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [NI U-Boot lci/20.0.0 only]

Signed-off-by: Joe Hershberger <joe.hershberger@ni.com>
---
 config.mk | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/config.mk b/config.mk
index a53ca90491c4685809a306bff9489d85e8376c67..0000000 100644
--- a/config.mk
+++ b/config.mk
@@ -243,0 +244,1 @@
+CFLAGS += -std=gnu89 -fgnu89-inline
-- 
2.47.0
